# Local development secrets for the API Worker.
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in the values. `.dev.vars` is never
# committed; this example file is.
#
# The same values are set on the deployed Worker with `wrangler secret put`.

# The signing key for session cookies. Generate a fresh value per environment:
#   openssl rand -base64 32
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=""

# Social sign-in — the client ID and secret come from the provider console.
# A provider without credentials is simply not offered in the UI.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=""
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=""

FACEBOOK_CLIENT_ID=""
FACEBOOK_CLIENT_SECRET=""
